A blank before only invisible lines loosens the list

```
- :: term
  : payload

    %% c
- sub
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>payload</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
  <li><p>sub</p></li>
</ul>
```

```
